.wt-history-rail/

# A separate git repository with its own history, currently without a remote.
# `git add .` stages it as a gitlink to a commit no clone can resolve, so the
# directory arrives empty and unfixable. Decide it deliberately — a submodule
# with a real remote, or its own repository — rather than by staging sweep.
/marketing/
